  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-12\">\n    <header class=\"article-header\">\n        <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 12</h2>\n    </header>\n    <div class=\"article-content\">\n        <div class=\"article-text\">\n            <p class=\"intro-text\">Dans l'article 3, § 1er, de la même loi, un alinéa rédigé comme suit est inséré entre les alinéas 4 et 5:</p>\n            <blockquote class=\"inserted-text\">\n                <p>Par dérogation aux alinéas 2 et 3, les articles 2,</p>\n                <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"25°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">25°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"26°\"><span class=\"provision-text\">26°</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"31\"><span class=\"provision-text\">31, § 4</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"32/1\"><span class=\"provision-text\">32/1</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"32/2\"><span class=\"provision-text\">32/2</span></li>\n                    <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"68/1\"><span class=\"provision-text\">68/1</span></li>\n                </ol>\n                <p>s'appliquent à toutes les concessions de travaux ou de services, indépendamment de leur valeur.</p>\n            </blockquote>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</article>",
